# Kalkman Construction — website source

Static site, no build step, no dependencies. Hosted free on GitHub Pages at
www.kalkman-construction.com.

## Structure

URLs deliberately match the previous WordPress site exactly, so nothing that
Google has already indexed breaks. GitHub Pages serves `about/index.html` at
`/about/`, which is how the match works — **don't rename these folders.**

    /                                   index.html
    /about/                             who we are
    /contact/                           contact page
    /gallery/                           project gallery (supports ?cat=Decks)
    /blog/                              blog index
    /areas-we-serve/                    service area overview
    /privacy-policy/
    /services/kitchen-remodelers/
    /services/bathroom-remodelers/
    /services/home-remodeling-contractors/
    /services/new-home-builders/
    /services/home-addition-contractors/
    /services/deck-contractors/
    /services/custom-cabinetry-built-ins/
    /services/basement-garage-conversions/
    /lakeside-mt/
    /bigfork-mt/

`assets/` holds photos, the logo, and `site.js`. `sitemap.xml`, `robots.txt`,
`CNAME`, and `.nojekyll` are all required — don't delete them.

## Contact form

Formspree endpoint `https://formspree.io/f/xbdnpwdv`, set on every page.
Submits by AJAX so the visitor stays put: the form swaps to a thank-you panel
on success, or shows a "call us instead" message if it fails.

Field names matter: `email` and `message` must keep those exact names —
Formspree uses `email` to set reply-to, so you can just hit Reply on a lead.
`_subject` sets the email subject, `_gotcha` is a spam honeypot.

## Making updates

Any file can be edited in the GitHub web UI (open file → pencil → commit) or
replaced via "Add file → Upload files". Changes go live a minute or two after
committing to `main`.

Adding a new photo to the gallery: upload the image to `assets/`, then add a
matching `<div class="g-item" data-cat="...">` block in `gallery/index.html`.

## Regenerating

The site was generated from templates so headers, footers, and the contact form
stay identical across all 17 pages. If you need a change applied site-wide,
it's a template change rather than 17 edits.
